{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURGEPOINT</strong> is a roguelike boomer shooter inspired by <i>Risk of Rain</i> and <i>Quake</i>. Craft your arsenal from scratch, master movement that rewards creativity, and survive as long as you can in a corporate death game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER THE SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a prisoner of <strong>SurgePoint Industries</strong>, a megacorp that throws inmates into combat simulations to stress-test experimental weapon technology. Every run, you're dropped into the arena to fight waves of combat bots. Your job? Find the perfect weapon combination before you die. Again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no escape. There's no winning. There's only <i>lasting longer than last time.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR GUNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no pre-made guns in SurgePoint. Just parts. Find barrels, bodies, mags, grips, and sights during your run and snap them together to create something deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine a <strong>Splitting Barrel</strong> with a <strong>Shotgun Body</strong> and <strong>Explosive Mag</strong> to spray explosive projectiles across the room. Or load <strong>Bouncy Ammo</strong> into a <strong>Ripper Body</strong> and turn tight corridors into a bullet hell. Ricochets fly off every wall until nothing's left standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield never stays the same. Swap components on the fly to adapt or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.poster.avif?t=1770066452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.webm?t=1770066452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.mp4?t=1770066452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREAK THE SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't won by raw firepower alone. It's about speed, positioning, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and strafe through procedurally-assembled arenas. Your gun kicks. Hard. Master the recoil to dodge incoming fire, reposition mid-fight, or launch yourself skyward. High-recoil builds hit like trucks but send you flying. Low-recoil builds keep you grounded but won't save you from a swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies don't fight fair. Neither should you. Deploy <strong>Holocubes</strong> to create temporary platforms. Block choke points to buy yourself time, reflect bouncy rounds into enemies behind cover, or climb to rooftops and hidden areas the bots can't reach.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/7785549509c043f260f0a0d7172c2188.poster.avif?t=1770066452\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/7785549509c043f260f0a0d7172c2188.webm?t=1770066452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/7785549509c043f260f0a0d7172c2188.mp4?t=1770066452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"And so it begins...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3342130/7b50b064b770f96751342219a56a2ddcca8385ad.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342130?t=1770066452","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342130?t=1770066452","capsu