Splitting Barrel</strong> with a <strong>Shotgun Body</strong> and <strong>Explosive Mag</strong> to spray explosive projectiles across the room. Or load <strong>Bouncy Ammo</strong> into a <strong>Ripper Body</strong> and turn tight corridors into a bullet hell. Ricochets fly off every wall until nothing's left standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield never stays the same. Swap components on the fly to adapt or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.poster.avif?t=1770066452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.webm?t=1770066452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342130/extras/32393209a1332e34640e7554f8b6cbf6.mp4?t=1770066452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREAK THE SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't won by raw firepower alone. It's about speed, positioning, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and strafe through procedurally-assembled arenas. Your gun kicks. Hard. Master the recoil to dodge incoming fire, reposition mid-fight, or launch yourself skyward. High-recoil builds hit like trucks but send you flying. Low-recoil builds keep you grounded but won't save you from a swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies don't fight fair. Neither should you. Deploy <strong>Holocubes</strong> to create temporary platforms. Block choke points to buy yourself time, reflect bouncy rounds into enemies behind cover, or climb to rooftops and hidden areas the bots can't reach.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta